  "details": "Clicking play, the eac launcher loads and goes through the motions, closes as expected where it should be switching to the vrchat exe, but vrchat never runs, and the stop button in steam switches back to play. The logfiles in the appdata/locallow/vrchat/vrchat folder are never touched.\n\nThe vrchat exe will run standalone in offline mode, loading me into the error world as expected.\n\nThis is an older install of steam, up to date, but using Debian's older file locations for its install in the ~/.steam directory, and am using GE-Proton 7-10.\n\nRunning the same library folder install of vrchat does work in debian 12 with GE-Proton 7-10, but I'm unable to use that for more than brief periods due to 12's incompatibilities with practically everything I do.\n\nPrevious live version had no issues, nor did beta before 1431(iirc) where this started happening.",
